### 회원가입
POST http://127.0.0.1:8000/api/auth/register/
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "username": "user1",
  "password": "testpass123",
  "email": "user1@example.com"
}

### JWT 로그인
POST http://127.0.0.1:8000/api/auth/token/
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "username": "user1",
  "password": "testpass123"
}

### 내 정보 조회
GET http://127.0.0.1:8000/api/auth/me/
Authorization: Bearer {{access_token}}

### 질문 생성
POST http://127.0.0.1:8000/api/questions/
Authorization: Bearer {{access_token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "subject": "DRF 질문입니다.",
  "content": "Serializer와 ViewSet은 어떤 역할인가요?"
}

### 질문 목록
GET http://127.0.0.1:8000/api/questions/

### 답변 생성
POST http://127.0.0.1:8000/api/questions/1/answers/
Authorization: Bearer {{access_token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "content": "Serializer는 변환과 검증, ViewSet은 API 요청 처리를 담당합니다."
}

### 채팅 세션 생성
POST http://127.0.0.1:8000/api/chat/sessions/
Authorization: Bearer {{access_token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "title": "DRF 상담"
}

### 챗봇 메시지 전송
POST http://127.0.0.1:8000/api/chat/sessions/1/send/
Authorization: Bearer {{access_token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "content": "JWT 인증 흐름을 설명해줘."
}
